        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>CASE AND CONSIDERATION 案例与思考</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$']] }\n};\n</script>\n<script async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n* { box-sizing: border-box; }\nhtml, body {\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n  background: #e9e9e9;\n}\nbody {\n  font-family: \"SimSun\", \"Songti SC\", serif;\n  color: #333;\n}\n.page {\n  position: relative;\n  width: 540px;\n  height: 764px;\n  margin: 0 auto;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: #fff;\n}\n.watermark {\n  position: absolute;\n  width: 150px;\n  height: 48px;\n  border: 2px solid rgba(164, 177, 174, .13);\n  transform: rotate(-28deg);\n  z-index: 0;\n}\n.w1 { left: -56px; top: 7px; }\n.w2 { left: 137px; top: 5px; }\n.w3 { left: 354px; top: 6px; }\n.w4 { left: -60px; top: 177px; }\n.w5 { left: 176px; top: 172px; }\n.w6 { left: 398px; top: 174px; }\n.w7 { left: -57px; top: 357px; }\n.w8 { left: 165px; top: 351px; }\n.w9 { left: 397px; top: 355px; }\n.w10 { left: -58px; top: 563px; }\n.w11 { left: 168px; top: 550px; }\n.w12 { left: 396px; top: 555px; }\n.header {\n  position: absolute;\n  z-index: 2;\n  top: 47px;\n  left: 38px;\n  width: 469px;\n  height: 22px;\n  border-top: 1px solid #9fc4a9;\n  border-bottom: 1px solid #c8ddd0;\n}\n.header-title {\n  position: absolute;\n  right: 0;\n  top: 2px;\n  padding-left: 10px;\n  background: #fff;\n  font-family: \"Times New Roman\", \"SimSun\", serif;\n  font-size: 10px;\n  font-weight: bold;\n  line-height: 16px;\n  color: #202020;\n}\n.content {\n  position: absolute;\n  z-index: 2;\n  left: 38px;\n  top: 170px;\n  width: 458px;\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: 221px 224px;\n  column-gap: 13px;\n  align-items: start;\n}\n.column {\n  min-width: 0;\n  font-size: 10px;\n  line-height: 15.1px;\n  text-align: justify;\n  text-justify: inter-ideograph;\n}\np {\n  margin: 0;\n  text-indent: 2em;\n}\n.no-indent { text-indent: 0; }\n.section-label {\n  margin: 0;\n  padding-left: 12px;\n  text-indent: 0;\n  line-height: 15px;\n  font-weight: bold;\n}\n.fragment {\n  margin-top: 1px;\n  text-indent: 0;\n  font-weight: bold;\n}\n.placeholder {\n  position: relative;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  border: 1px solid #d4d4d4;\n  color: rgba(255,255,255,.9);\n  font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n  font-size: 8px;\n  text-align: center;\n  text-shadow: 0 1px 2px #333;\n}\n.placeholder::before,\n.placeholder::after {\n  content: \"\";\n  position: absolute;\n  inset: 0;\n  z-index: 0;\n}\n.placeholder::after {\n  background:\n    linear-gradient(90deg,\n      transparent 32%, rgba(255,255,255,.8) 32%, rgba(255,255,255,.8) 33%, transparent 33%,\n      transparent 64%, rgba(255,255,255,.8) 64%, rgba(255,255,255,.8) 65%, transparent 65%);\n}\n.placeholder span {\n  position: absolute;\n  z-index: 2;\n  left: 4px;\n  bottom: 2px;\n  padding: 1px 3px;\n  background: rgba(0,0,0,.34);\n}\n.photo-left {\n  width: 221px;\n  height: 79px;\n  margin-bottom: 9px;\n}\n.photo-left::before {\n  background:\n    radial-gradient(circle at 46% 50%, #a799a5 0 8%, transparent 9%),\n    radial-gradient(circle at 80% 52%, #49494a 0 8%, transparent 9%),\n    linear-gradient(125deg, #486765 0 18%, #ac8a55 18% 43%, #c3a772 43% 67%, #887653 67% 100%);\n}\n.photo-top-right {\n  width: 224px;\n  height: 79px;\n  margin-top: 5px;\n  margin-bottom: 6px;\n}\n.photo-top-right::before {\n  background:\n    radial-gradient(circle at 17% 55%, #755747 0 8%, transparent 9%),\n    radial-gradient(circle at 74% 54%, #57423c 0 9%, transparent 10%),\n    linear-gradient(120deg, #996d42 0 22%, #3284a1 22% 42%, #b99b65 42% 65%, #6b91a0 65% 100%);\n}\n.photo-mid-right {\n  width: 224px;\n  height: 84px;\n  margin-top: 8px;\n  margin-bottom: 7px;\n}\n.photo-mid-right::before {\n  background:\n    radial-gradient(circle at 23% 42%, #493c39 0 7%, transparent 8%),\n    radial-gradient(circle at 74% 42%, #4f4541 0 8%, transparent 9%),\n    linear-gradient(145deg, #ac8b55 0 31%, #1d83a8 31% 48%, #c49d61 48% 70%, #287da2 70% 100%);\n}\n.highlight {\n  display: table;\n  margin: 1px 0;\n  padding: 0 3px;\n  background: #fff100;\n  font-weight: bold;\n  line-height: 14px;\n  text-indent: 0;\n}\n.reflection {\n  margin-top: 4px;\n  padding-left: 18px;\n}\n.footer {\n  position: absolute;\n  z-index: 3;\n  left: 20px;\n  bottom: 22px;\n  width: 490px;\n  height: 18px;\n  color: #9d9d9d;\n  font-family: \"Times New Roman\", serif;\n  font-size: 9px;\n  white-space: nowrap;\n}\n.footer-right {\n  position: absolute;\n  right: 25px;\n  bottom: 22px;\n  z-index: 4;\n  color: #555;\n  font-family: \"SimSun\", serif;\n  font-size: 7px;\n  text-align: right;\n  line-height: 9px;\n}\n.page-number {\n  position: absolute;\n  z-index: 4;\n  right: 32px;\n  bottom: 22px;\n  color: #202020;\n  font-family: \"Times New Roman\", serif;\n  font-size: 15px;\n  font-weight: bold;\n}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n  <div class=\"watermark w1\"></div>\n  <div class=\"watermark w2\"></div>\n  <div class=\"watermark w3\"></div>\n  <div class=\"watermark w4\"></div>\n  <div class=\"watermark w5\"></div>\n  <div class=\"watermark w6\"></div>\n  <div class=\"watermark w7\"></div>\n  <div class=\"watermark w8\"></div>\n  <div class=\"watermark w9\"></div>\n  <div class=\"watermark w10\"></div>\n  <div class=\"watermark w11\"></div>\n  <div class=\"watermark w12\"></div>\n\n  <header class=\"header\">\n    <div class=\"header-title\">CASE AND CONSIDERATION 案例与思考</div>\n  </header>\n\n  <main class=\"content\">\n    <section class=\"column left-column\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder photo-left\">\n        <span>[Photo: children exploring with water and sand]</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <p>起来，水也就随着管空了流走了。幼儿沉不住气了，纷纷议论起来：“这是怎么回事？袋子都装上来了。”“可能是袋子太轻了，我们用石头把它压住吧！”幼儿将塑料袋再次套牢浮桶，又搬来石头压住塑料袋的四周。</p>\n\n      <div class=\"section-label\">【教师的支持】</div>\n      <p>在接连的失败过后，教师根据幼儿[illegible]需要，根据幼儿在探究活动中表现出的乐于想象和敢于探究的良好学习品质，教师只需简单地引导即可。当观察到幼儿出现距离较长和倾斜情况时，教师开始考虑如何变相应帮助幼儿解决困难。</p>\n\n      <div class=\"section-label\">【幼儿的探究结果】</div>\n      <p>这一次会成功吗？“我看到水里有泡泡冒出来，是不是又漏水了？”“我看也是，水变少了。”“可不是嘛，做一个‘海洋池’还挺难的呢！”幼儿在观察中发现用石头压着袋子四周后，大的袋[illegible]。“可能是袋子太小了。”“大小了就需要很多袋子连起来。”“但袋子很多就又会有很多缝隙。”幼儿一筹莫展，接着“海洋池”在一次次的探究后都以失败告终。</p>\n\n      <div class=\"fragment\">片断六：用水盆蓄水</div>\n      <div class=\"section-label\">【幼儿的问题】</div>\n      <p>[illegible]以来，幼儿都被沙子的渗水性所困扰着，这是导致“海洋池”无法蓄水的主要原因。教师为了进一步激发幼儿探究的兴趣，提出了这样的问题：“我们可不可以找一个东西把沙和水隔开来。”</p>\n\n      <div class=\"section-label\">【幼儿的探究与发现】</div>\n      <p>“海洋池”是长方形的，因此幼儿明白自己所需要的材料是一个不漏水的长方形容器。部分幼儿提议：“不如直接用蓝色的长方形水盆吧！”如果挖一个大大小小的坑，把水盆埋到地底下，似乎就不用担心水会流进沙子里了。就</p>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"column right-column\">\n      <p>这样，幼儿再次寻找适宜的材料，用两个水盆组装起了“海洋池”。</p>\n\n      <div class=\"placeholder photo-top-right\">\n        <span>[Photo: children assembling water basins and pipes]</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <p>幼儿通过选择不同的PVC管，不断更改管道的长度，为两个水盆架起了最为适宜的注水管道。他们将塑料海洋生物投放到“海洋池”中，让这些动物们在里面欢快地“游泳”。至此，“欢乐海洋馆”成功建立起来，过去有漏水的问题都得到了有效的解决。</p>\n\n      <div class=\"placeholder photo-mid-right\">\n        <span>[Photo: children beside blue water basins]</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"section-label\">【教师的支持】</div>\n      <p>幼儿选择水盆作为“海洋池”的底部，直接避免了水与沙子的接触，从根源上阻断了水渗入沙子的问题。尽管这样的办法与之前的探究过程相比，毫无挑战性，违背了之前的设计思路和探究方向。但是，教师认为“海洋池”的制作对于中班幼儿来说，已经完全超出了他们的能力范围，[illegible]。这一次的失败，让教师明白及时改变支持幼儿获得成功，一味地营造困境与挫折只会让幼儿在以后的活动中失去探究的积极性。</p>\n\n      <div class=\"reflection\">\n        <div class=\"highlight\">三、故事的反思</div>\n        <div class=\"highlight\">（一）教师的反思</div>\n        <div class=\"highlight\">1.活动价值分析。</div>\n      </div>\n      <p>该班幼儿，喜欢海峡。本次活动是一次幼儿自主生成的项目学习活动，活动围绕着沙子蓄水性这一物理现象而</p>\n    </section>\n  </main>\n\n  <footer class=\"footer\">\n    (C) 1994-2022 China Academic Journal Electronic Publishing House. All rights reserved.　http://www.cnki.net\n  </footer>\n  <div class=\"footer-right\">2020.09 幼儿100</div>\n  <div class=\"page-number\">51</div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
